{{also|takeup|take up}}
==English==

===Etymology===
From the verb phrase {{m|en|take up}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun|~|head=[[take]]-[[up]]}}

# The act of taking something up, by [[tightening]], [[absorption]], or [[reeling]] in.
# {{lb|en|machinery}} That which takes up or [[tighten]]s; specifically, a device in a [[sewing]] [[machine]] or [[loom]] for drawing up the [[slack]] thread as the [[needle]] rises, in completing a [[stitch]].
# [[acceptance|Acceptance]] (of a proposal, offer, request, etc.).

